==Problem description==
Repairing a water damaged L406M laptop.
[[File:Asus L406M.jpg|thumb|Figure 1]]

==Symptoms==

*Corrosion
*Not turning on
*LED not illuminating

==Solution==

* the most damage was done in the area marked J5601 on the board.
* some contacts of resistors and other chips were corroded there.
* after repairing the contact to the board via soldering, the machine started.